"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">35</div><h1>단어 만들기</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wortbildung</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 35의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B2 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 9 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">동사와 형용사에서 명사를 만들고 성을 정해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">-ig·-lich·-bar·-los·-voll·-reich로 형용사를 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">un-·miss-와 be-·ver-·ent-·zer-의 뜻으로 단어를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">긴 합성어를 뒤에서부터 풀어 뜻과 성을 알아요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Vorbereitung&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vorbereiten)</span> auf die Prüfung hat fast drei Monate gedauert.</div><div class=\"qko\">시험 준비에 거의 석 달이 걸렸어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die <b>Vorbereitung</b> auf die Prüfung hat fast drei Monate gedauert.</div>동사 어간 + -ung → die Vorbereitung. -ung 명사는 늘 여성이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Der <span class=\"qblank\"></span> von Frankfurt nach Seoul dauert etwa elf Stunden.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Flog</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Fliegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Flug</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Fliegung</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fliegen에서 어간만 남기고 모음을 바꿔 der Flug가 돼요.<br>어간에서 온 명사는 대부분 남성이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Anruf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Vielen Dank für deinen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(anrufen)</span> gestern Abend!</div><div class=\"qko\">어제저녁에 전화해 줘서 정말 고마워요!</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Vielen Dank für deinen <b>Anruf</b> gestern Abend!</div>anrufen → der Anruf. 어간만 남긴 명사라서 남성이고, deinen(남성 4격)과도 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> '요리할 때는 늘 라디오를 들어요.'<br><span class=\"qblank\"></span> höre ich immer Radio.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bei der Kochung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Beim Kochen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Beim kochen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bei Kochen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">원형을 명사로 쓰면 대문자로 쓰고 중성이에요 → bei + dem = beim Kochen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Verkäuferin&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(verkaufen · 여자)</span> in der Bäckerei an der Ecke ist immer gut gelaunt.</div><div class=\"qko\">모퉁이 빵집의 여자 판매원은 늘 기분이 좋아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die <b>Verkäuferin</b> in der Bäckerei an der Ecke ist immer gut gelaunt.</div>어간 + -er는 하는 사람이에요. 모음이 바뀌어 Verkäufer, 여자는 -in을 붙여요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Drucker&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Mein <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(drucken)</span> druckt nicht mehr, die Patrone ist leer.</div><div class=\"qko\">제 프린터가 더 이상 인쇄가 안 돼요, 잉크가 떨어졌어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein <b>Drucker</b> druckt nicht mehr, die Patrone ist leer.</div>어간 + -er는 도구도 나타내요 → der Drucker.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> pünktlich → die Pünktlich<span class=\"qblank\"></span></div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) keit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) e</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) heit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-lich로 끝나는 형용사에는 -keit을 붙여요 → die Pünktlichkeit.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Faulheit&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Seine <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(faul)</span> ärgert alle im Team, er macht nie seinen Teil der Arbeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">그의 게으름에 팀원 모두가 화가 나요, 그는 자기 몫의 일을 절대 하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Seine <b>Faulheit</b> ärgert alle im Team, er macht nie seinen Teil der Arbeit.</div>faul은 -ig·-lich·-bar·-sam으로 끝나지 않으니 -heit이에요 → die Faulheit.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Höhe&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Der Fernsehturm hat eine <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(hoch)</span> von 150 Metern.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 방송탑은 높이가 150미터예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Fernsehturm hat eine <b>Höhe</b> von 150 Metern.</div>-e를 붙이고 모음을 바꿔요 → die Höhe. hoch의 ch는 빠져요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schmutzig&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Nach der Wanderung im Regen waren unsere Schuhe total <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(der Schmutz)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">빗속에서 하이킹을 하고 나니 신발이 완전히 더러워졌어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nach der Wanderung im Regen waren unsere Schuhe total <b>schmutzig</b>.</div>명사 + -ig는 '~⁠이 있는'이에요 → schmutzig.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;monatlich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Die Miete wird <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(der Monat)</span> bezahlt.</div><div class=\"qko\">월세는 매달 내요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Miete wird <b>monatlich</b> bezahlt.</div>-lich는 '~⁠마다'라는 뜻도 있어요 → monatlich.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;waschbar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Diese Decke kann man in der Maschine waschen. Sie ist <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(waschen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 이불은 세탁기에 빨 수 있어요. 세탁이 가능해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Diese Decke kann man in der Maschine waschen. Sie ist <b>waschbar</b>.</div>동사 어간 + -bar = '~⁠될 수 있는' → waschbar.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Mein Onkel macht ständig Witze. Er ist sehr <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) humorlos</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) humorlich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) humorbar</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) humorvoll</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-voll은 '~⁠이 가득한'이에요 → humorvoll.<br>humorlos는 반대로 '유머가 없는'이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unzufrieden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Mit dem Service im Hotel waren wir gar nicht zufrieden. Wir waren sehr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(zufrieden)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">호텔 서비스에 전혀 만족하지 못했어요. 아주 불만이었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mit dem Service im Hotel waren wir gar nicht zufrieden. Wir waren sehr <b>unzufrieden</b>.</div>un-을 붙이면 반대말이 돼요 → unzufrieden.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Geburtstagsgeschenk의 성은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) die</button></div><div class=\"qe\">합성어는 맨 뒤 명사가 성을 정해요 → das Geschenk → das Geburtstagsgeschenk.<br>-s-는 이음 글자예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Rauchen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(rauchen)</span> ist auf dem ganzen Bahnhof verboten.</div><div class=\"qko\">역 전체에서 흡연이 금지돼 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das <b>Rauchen</b> ist auf dem ganzen Bahnhof verboten.</div>원형을 그대로 명사로 쓰면 동작 자체를 뜻하고 중성이에요. 첫 글자는 대문자예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Stärke&quot;],[&quot;Schwäche&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ihre <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(stark)</span> ist Mathematik, ihre <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(schwach)</span> ist die Rechtschreibung.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀의 강점은 수학이고, 약점은 맞춤법이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ihre <b>Stärke</b> ist Mathematik, ihre <b>Schwäche</b> ist die Rechtschreibung.</div>형용사에 -e를 붙이고 모음을 바꿔요 → die Stärke · die Schwäche. 둘 다 여성이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Was schätzen Sie an Ihrem Team am meisten? — Die <span class=\"qblank\"></span> meiner Kollegen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Zuverlässung</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Zuverlässe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Zuverlässigkeit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Zuverlässigheit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zuverlässig는 -ig로 끝나니 -keit을 붙여요 → die Zuverlässigkeit.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Wir sind auf den höchsten Berg der Region gestiegen.<br>= Wir haben den höchsten Berg der Region <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) gestiegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) verstiegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) bestiegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) aufbestiegen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">be-가 붙으면 전치사 없이 4격 목적어를 받아요 → einen Berg besteigen.<br>비분리 접두어라서 ge-가 없고, 4격 목적어를 받으니 haben이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;verhört&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Entschuldigung, da habe ich mich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(hören + 접두어)</span>. Ich habe „Dienstag“ verstanden.</div><div class=\"qko\">죄송해요, 제가 잘못 들었어요. 화요일로 알아들었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Entschuldigung, da habe ich mich <b>verhört</b>. Ich habe „Dienstag“ verstanden.</div>ver-는 '잘못'이라는 뜻이 있어요 → sich verhören(잘못 듣다).<br>비분리 접두어라서 과거분사에 ge-가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Unser Hund ist gestern aus dem Garten <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. 정원에서 달아났어요</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) erlaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) zerlaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) entlaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) verlaufen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ent-는 '벗어남'이에요 → entlaufen(달아나다).<br>verlaufen은 sich verlaufen(길을 잃다)으로 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Kinderzimmertür — 성과 뜻이 바른 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die — 문이 있는 아이 방</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) das — 아이 방의 문</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) die — 아이 방의 문</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) das — 문이 있는 아이 방</button></div><div class=\"qe\">뒤에서부터 풀어요 → die Tür(문)가 중심이에요.<br>Kinder + Zimmer + Tür = 아이 방의 문, 성은 die예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Verkäufer hat uns beim Kauf des Fernsehers gut beraten&quot;,&quot;Beim Kauf des Fernsehers hat uns der Verkäufer gut beraten&quot;,&quot;Beim Kauf des Fernsehers hat der Verkäufer uns gut beraten&quot;,&quot;Uns hat der Verkäufer beim Kauf des Fernsehers gut beraten&quot;,&quot;Der Verkäufer hat uns gut beim Kauf des Fernsehers beraten&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">판매원이 텔레비전을 살 때 우리에게 조언을 잘 해 줬어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">beraten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">uns</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Fernsehers</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">gut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">des</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">beim</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Kauf</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Verkäufer</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Verkäufer hat uns beim Kauf des Fernsehers gut beraten.</b></div>raten은 3격(jemandem raten), be-가 붙은 beraten은 4격(uns)을 바로 받아요.<br>kaufen → der Kauf, 2격은 des Fernsehers예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;erkennbar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> Den Unterschied kann man kaum erkennen.<br>→ Der Unterschied ist kaum <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(erkennen)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">차이를 거의 알아볼 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Den Unterschied kann man kaum erkennen.<br>→ Der Unterschied ist kaum <b>erkennbar</b>.</div>-bar는 '~⁠될 수 있는'이라는 수동의 뜻이에요 → erkennbar = kann erkannt werden.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Ergebnisse der beiden Studien sind kaum vergleichbar&quot;,&quot;Kaum vergleichbar sind die Ergebnisse der beiden Studien&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">두 연구의 결과는 거의 비교할 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">sind</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Studien</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">kaum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Ergebnisse</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">vergleichbar</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">beiden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">der</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Ergebnisse der beiden Studien sind kaum vergleichbar.</b></div>vergleichen + -bar → vergleichbar(비교될 수 있는).<br>der beiden Studien은 2격 복수예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> 틀린 표현은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die Dankbarkeit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) die Klugkeit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) die Einsamkeit</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) die Offenheit</button></div><div class=\"qe\">klug는 -ig·-lich·-bar·-sam으로 끝나지 않아서 -heit → die Klugheit예요.<br>einsam(-sam)·dankbar(-bar)는 -keit, offen은 -heit이 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Eröffnung&quot;],[&quot;Besucher&quot;],[&quot;lehrreich&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(eröffnen)</span> des neuen Museums war ein großer Erfolg. Die meisten <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(besuchen · 복수)</span> waren von der Ausstellung begeistert, und die Führung war sehr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Lehre + 접미사)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">새 박물관의 개관은 큰 성공이었어요. 방문객 대부분이 전시에 열광했고, 가이드 투어는 아주 유익했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die <b>Eröffnung</b> des neuen Museums war ein großer Erfolg. Die meisten <b>Besucher</b> waren von der Ausstellung begeistert, und die Führung war sehr <b>lehrreich</b>.</div>eröffnen → die Eröffnung(-ung) · besuchen → der Besucher, 복수도 Besucher · die Lehre + -reich(~⁠이 많은) → lehrreich.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> 뜻이 같은 문장은?<br>Das Problem ist lösbar.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das Problem wurde schon gelöst.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Das Problem muss gelöst werden.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Das Problem löst sich.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Das Problem kann gelöst werden.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">-bar는 '~⁠될 수 있는'이에요. 화법조동사 können + 수동태로 바꿔 말할 수 있어요(31과).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;zerschnitten&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Sie hat das alte T-Shirt in kleine Stücke <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:14ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schneiden + 접두어)</span> und benutzt sie jetzt als Putzlappen.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 낡은 티셔츠를 잘게 잘라서 지금 걸레로 써요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Sie hat das alte T-Shirt in kleine Stücke <b>zerschnitten</b> und benutzt sie jetzt als Putzlappen.</div>zer-는 '조각내서 망가뜨림'이에요 → zerschneiden.<br>불규칙 동사(geschnitten)지만 비분리 접두어가 붙어서 ge-가 빠져요 → zerschnitten.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wegen seiner Unpünktlichkeit hat er die Stelle nicht bekommen&quot;,&quot;Er hat wegen seiner Unpünktlichkeit die Stelle nicht bekommen&quot;,&quot;Er hat die Stelle wegen seiner Unpünktlichkeit nicht bekommen&quot;,&quot;Die Stelle hat er wegen seiner Unpünktlichkeit nicht bekommen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 지각하는 버릇 때문에 그 일자리를 얻지 못했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wegen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">bekommen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">seiner</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Stelle</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Unpünktlichkeit</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wegen seiner Unpünktlichkeit hat er die Stelle nicht bekommen.</b></div>un- + pünktlich + -keit → die Unpünktlichkeit. 여성이라서 wegen 뒤 2격은 seiner예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">31.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Seit Jahren bewohnen sie in einem alten Bauernhaus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Firma beliefert viele Supermärkte in der Region.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir haben die Kunden über die Änderungen informiert.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Der Lehrer bewertet die Aufsätze sehr streng.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">be- 동사는 전치사 없이 4격을 받아요 → Sie bewohnen ein altes Bauernhaus. (in einem Bauernhaus wohnen과 섞은 실수)</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"31\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 31</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"